From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] unit: test EuiccManager.ResetCard

Builds the real src/sim.c on a small model of the modem and the runtime
driver registry, with a scripted SIM driver that finishes a reset when
the test says so, and calls ResetCard from a second bus connection.

The caller is answered only once the driver has finished, with the
driver's result, exactly once, also for one reset after another. A
driver without reset_card gives NotImplemented, and so does one that
has the member set but registers as SIM driver API version 2, which
predates it: the registry must cut it off rather than call whatever
lies past the end of the plugin's struct.

Runs under dbus-run-session; without a bus it reports itself skipped.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 Makefile.am           |  12 +
 unit/test-sim-euicc.c | 677 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
